# Kitsune: if one of the two targets is illegal as the ability resolves, the exchange can't be completed and none of it happens
# (CR 701.12a, 608.2b; its ruling), and no question is asked. In response Bot2 bolts Bot1's Ornithopter; Bot2 keeps the Elves.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Ornithopter
Memnite
Kitsune, Dragon's Daughter
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Forest x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Kitsune, Dragon's Daughter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter; Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Kitsune, Dragon's Daughter; Memnite; Mox Jet; Mox Ruby; Mox Sapphire
Bot1.Graveyard = Ornithopter; Black Lotus
Bot2.Battlefield = Forest; Llanowar Elves; Mox Ruby
Bot2.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt
